{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Imagine if Beer Pong grew legs and turned into a chaotic physics brawler.</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Score in the Top, or Not at All</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/93172e2834075dd6b1eabc07d58f3487.poster.avif?t=1761665727\" aria-label=\"Score in the top of your friends&#039; cup\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/93172e2834075dd6b1eabc07d58f3487.webm?t=1761665727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/93172e2834075dd6b1eabc07d58f3487.mp4?t=1761665727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to <strong>4 players</strong>, locally or online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate opponents by landing your shot in the <strong>top of their cup\u00a0</strong>\u2014 or blast them off the stage instead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull off <strong>bounce plays</strong>, <strong>wild ricochets</strong>, and <strong>satisfying trickshots </strong>to secure the round.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Powerups That Flip the Fight</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/9ef94cbeeb4773d82dac4890ab2b9b05.poster.avif?t=1761665727\" aria-label=\"Use chaotic powerups to take out others\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/9ef94cbeeb4773d82dac4890ab2b9b05.webm?t=1761665727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/9ef94cbeeb4773d82dac4890ab2b9b05.mp4?t=1761665727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pickup wild powerup balls that spawn mid-match and flip the game in your favor:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire an <strong>RPG</strong> that bursts into a frenzy of mini balls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steer a<strong> Remote-Control Ball</strong>\u00a0to hit impossible angles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch a<strong> Shockwave Ball</strong>\u00a0to send opponents into the stratosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash a<strong> mini black hole</strong> that devours everything around it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...<strong>with even more chaotic surprises waiting to be discovered</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every powerup is physics-driven, and designed for <strong>chaotic, clip-worthy \u201cYOOOOOOO!\u201d moments.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <strong>Pick an Ability Before the Match</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/8656398cf8e8c6cb65cc994135b89b9f.poster.avif?t=1761665727\" aria-label=\"Pick and use various abilities to change your playstyle (wind blast shown here)\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/8656398cf8e8c6cb65cc994135b89b9f.webm?t=1761665727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/8656398cf8e8c6cb65cc994135b89b9f.mp4?t=1761665727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each set of rounds, choose<strong> one ability</strong>\u00a0to define your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice reshapes how you fight and score\u00a0\u2014 adding strategy on top of the chaos.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wind Blast:</strong> parry incoming attacks\u00a0\u2014 or just blast players away</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dash:</strong>\u00a0dodge danger by inches or reposition for your next big shot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Undying:</strong>\u00a0after death return as a ghost\u00a0\u2014 possess whoever you score on and control them</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>...and more abilities that completely change the way you play</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Shoot From the Grave</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/c05d7998f4230f74f5b90ba3923a70dc.poster.avif?t=1761665727\" aria-label=\"Even after death you can still shoot and score, but you only have one shot\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/c05d7998f4230f74f5b90ba3923a70dc.webm?t=1761665727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/c05d7998f4230f74f5b90ba3923a70dc.mp4?t=1761665727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you\u2019re holding a ball or powerup when eliminated, you get one final shot before hitting the ground.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It could be the difference between a draw and <strong>total defeat.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3619490?t=1761665727","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3619490?t=1761665727","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/b4705acb21fe81a1a48ac26de6781da34b11e5dd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761665727","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/b4705acb21fe81a1a48ac26de6781da34b11e5dd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761665727","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4063410,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>Imagine if Beer Pong grew legs and turned into a chaotic physics brawler.</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Score in the Top, or Not at All</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/93172e2834075dd6b1eabc07d58f3487.poster.avif?t=1761665727\" aria-label=\"Score in the top of your friends&#039; cup\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/93172e2834075dd6b1eabc07d58f3487.webm?t=1761665727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/93172e2834075dd6b1eabc07d58f3487.mp4?t=1761665727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to <strong>4 players</strong>, locally or online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate opponents by landing your shot in the <strong>top of their cup\u00a0</strong>\u2014 or blast them off the stage instead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pull off <strong>bounce plays</strong>, <strong>wild ricochets</strong>, and <strong>satisfying trickshots </strong>to secure the round.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Powerups That Flip the Fight</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/9ef94cbeeb4773d82dac4890ab2b9b05.poster.avif?t=1761665727\" aria-label=\"Use chaotic powerups to take out others\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/9ef94cbeeb4773d82dac4890ab2b9b05.webm?t=1761665727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/9ef94cbeeb4773d82dac4890ab2b9b05.mp4?t=1761665727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pickup wild powerup balls that spawn mid-match and flip the game in your favor:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fire an <strong>RPG</strong> that bursts into a frenzy of mini balls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steer a<strong> Remote-Control Ball</strong>\u00a0to hit impossible angles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch a<strong> Shockwave Ball</strong>\u00a0to send opponents into the stratosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash a<strong> mini black hole</strong> that devours everything around it</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...<strong>with even more chaotic surprises waiting to be discovered</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every powerup is physics-driven, and designed for <strong>chaotic, clip-worthy \u201cYOOOOOOO!\u201d moments.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <strong>Pick an Ability Before the Match</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/8656398cf8e8c6cb65cc994135b89b9f.poster.avif?t=1761665727\" aria-label=\"Pick and use various abilities to change your playstyle (wind blast shown here)\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/8656398cf8e8c6cb65cc994135b89b9f.webm?t=1761665727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/8656398cf8e8c6cb65cc994135b89b9f.mp4?t=1761665727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each set of rounds, choose<strong> one ability</strong>\u00a0to define your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice reshapes how you fight and score\u00a0\u2014 adding strategy on top of the chaos.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wind Blast:</strong> parry incoming attacks\u00a0\u2014 or just blast players away</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dash:</strong>\u00a0dodge danger by inches or reposition for your next big shot</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Undying:</strong>\u00a0after death return as a ghost\u00a0\u2014 possess whoever you score on and control them</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>...and more abilities that completely change the way you play</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Shoot From the Grave</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/c05d7998f4230f74f5b90ba3923a70dc.poster.avif?t=1761665727\" aria-label=\"Even after death you can still shoot and score, but you only have one shot\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/c05d7998f4230f74f5b90ba3923a70dc.webm?t=1761665727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/extras/c05d7998f4230f74f5b90ba3923a70dc.mp4?t=1761665727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you\u2019re holding a ball or powerup when eliminated, you get one final shot before hitting the ground.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It could be the difference between a draw and <strong>total defeat.</strong></p>","developers":["Lumari Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619490/6cfc44f622f7023c11b28845f671bc2ef6e75608/header.jpg?t=1761665727","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3619490/2019618200/6e694f94d3a6e51418adc7f1e11ceafd3d6286f7/1760063211/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760064133","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3619490/2019618200/6e694f94d3a6e51418adc7f1e11ceafd3d6286f7/1760063211/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760064133","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3619490/2019618200/6e694f94d3a6e51418adc7f1e11ceafd3d6286f7/1760063211/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760064133","id":257215276,"name":"Demo Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store